sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Agent
    participant P as OpenShell<br/>supervisor proxy
    participant O as OCC<br/>credential API
    participant I as OpenShell control<br/>plane issuer
    participant H as GitHub
    Note over A,H: Git request with an uncached credential lookup
    A->>P: Git request
    P->>O: Authorize and resolve<br/>request + execution identity
    Note over O: Check Agent grant,<br/>repo and operation
    O->>I: Resolve approved<br/>GitHub scope
    opt Issuer needs a new installation token
        I->>H: Sign with App key<br/>and request token
        H-->>I: Token and expiry
    end
    I-->>O: Scoped token
    O-->>P: Approved token
    P->>H: Inject token and send the Git request
    Note over A,H: OCC withdraws this Agent’s Git access
    A->>P: Next uncached request
    P->>O: Authorize and resolve
    O-->>P: Deny
    P-->>A: Access denied
